  step,dige:2b840e0ba238da72
  step=2,dige:5cf226ad429f5f2a
    Assertion:a-body-row-is,sentence:a body row is keyed by its own body key not the soul — one soul wears many bodies so the durable per-body key is what a roster row IS
    Assertion:the-body-key-is,sentence:the body key is durable and one per soul per store — ensure honours the cache and a second soul in the same store mints a key of its own
    Assertion:which-row-is-me,sentence:which row is me is computed from the body key never a stored flag — the mint writes no self bit onto the row so nothing false can replicate
  step=3,dige:94cc6f565e892219
    Assertion:the-self-answer-is,sentence:the self answer is body-local — a friend absorbing the roster computes its own body as self and no self flag ever crossed the wire
  step=4,dige:8fa3136b9456981b
    Assertion:the-vessel-subnet-picks,sentence:the vessel subnet picks the bare address first then ascends the suffixes — an individual local subnet has a deterministic primary and an empty one picks nothing
